    "perplexity": {
      "description": "Weezer (Coloring Book)\" is not a single album but a comprehensive 2026 limited-edition box set titled the Weezer Coloring Book, which celebrates all six color-themed albums by Weezer: Blue, Green, Red, White, Teal, and Black. This 6-LP collection presents each album pressed on its respective color vinyl, offering fans a complete auditory and visual journey through the band’s rock catalog. The centerpiece of the box set is a comprehensive book featuring 72 brand-new illustrations, with every song receiving a unique, custom artwork that listeners can personalize using the included set of six color markers matching the album hues.\n\nThe box set includes the full tracklists of all six albums, ranging from the Blue Album classics like \"My Name Is Jonas\" and \"Buddy Holly\" to the Black Album tracks such as \"Can’t Knock The Hustle\" and \"I’m Just Being Honest.\" A playful interactive element is embedded in the design, notably the inclusion of a white marker to color the illustrations tied to the White Album, prompting curiosity about hidden surprises or fun details within the artwork. Released by Universal Music Group, this exclusive edition is limited to four copies per customer and serves as both a collector’s item and an immersive experience that honors Weezer’s 34-year legacy and their distinctive color-album branding.\n\nArtistically, the set encapsulates the evolution of Weezer’s sound across decades, from the 90s power-pop of Blue to the experimental and cover-driven Teal album, and the modern rock of Black. The Coloring Book box set transforms the listening experience into a creative activity, allowing fans to engage directly with the music by coloring the illustrations while listening, making each copy a truly unique personal artifact. This release stands as a significant milestone in Weezer’s catalog, merging their musical history with interactive art to create a definitive celebration of their color-themed era.",
